  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>A sling stone of black glass with a pinprick of light at its heart.</em></p><p>When you hit a creature with an attack using this bullet, it bursts into a falling star. The target takes <strong>8d10 radiant damage</strong>, and every other creature within 15 feet of it must succeed on a <strong>DC 18 Dexterity saving throw</strong> or take <strong>4d10 fire damage</strong>, or half as much on a success.</p><p>The star leaves a glowing crater 15 feet in radius centred on the target's space. For 1 minute it is <strong>difficult terrain</strong> and sheds bright light in a 15-foot radius and dim light for a further 15 feet.</p><p>Once it hits, the bullet is destroyed.</p><details><summary>Midi-QOL</summary><p>An onUse macro on the bullet runs its hidden Impact, Burst and Crater activities when the sling's attack hits. The crater is created by the GM (a region with dnd5e's difficult terrain behavior, and a light); both are removed when the 1-minute Starfall Crater effect on the attacker ends.</p></details>",
      "chat": ""
